  "text": "\\begin{lemma}\nFor every nonnegative integer $n$,\n\\[\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n+k}{2k}\\frac{(-4)^k}{2k+1}\n=\\frac{(-1)^n}{2n+1},\n\\]\nand\n\\[\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n+k}{2k}\\frac{(-1)^k}{2k+1}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{(-1)^n}{2n+1},&\\text{if }3\\nmid 2n+1,\\\\\n\\dfrac{2(-1)^{n-1}}{2n+1},&\\text{if }3\\mid 2n+1.\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\\end{lemma}\n",
  "updated_at": "2026-07-12T12:57:52.318263+00:00",
  "formalization_rules": "\\begin{lemma}\nFor every nonnegative integer $n$,\n\\[\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n+k}{2k}\\frac{(-4)^k}{2k+1}\n=\\frac{(-1)^n}{2n+1},\n\\]\nand\n\\[\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n+k}{2k}\\frac{(-1)^k}{2k+1}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{(-1)^n}{2n+1},&\\text{if }3\\nmid 2n+1,\\\\\n\\dfrac{2(-1)^{n-1}}{2n+1},&\\text{if }3\\mid 2n+1.\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\\end{lemma}\n"
